WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:08.390
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:14.890
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.730
It's my day!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.310
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:34.710
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:42.090
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:49.490
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.270
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.410
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.910
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:16.050
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.120
I just want to walk

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.660
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.630
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:35.540
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.980
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.250
It's my day!

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.060
<i>Him... my boyfriend?</i>

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.310
<i>Stop waffling and
date him, will you?</i>

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:13.210
<i>It's annoying, watching you two.</i>

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:22.350
<i>I may not be able to run
from him anymore.</i>

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.330
<i>I hate this!</i>

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:34.730
You don't have to get so angry.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:36.930
I'm no stylist, you know.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.840
You can't expect it to be
perfectly straight!

00:02:40.940 --> 00:02:44.940
Dear... Tsukushi yelled at me!

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:47.750
What?

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:51.780
No! It looks awful!

00:02:52.080 --> 00:03:00.090
"The Woman In My Life!"

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.860
You recover as fast as a dog.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:07.400
A dog?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:11.540
<i>Domyoji's like... like a dog.</i>

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.010
Uh... but dogs are cute, right?

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:20.610
Yeah, they're really loyal.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.850
One more word out of you
and I'll kill you.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.590
You wouldn't understand...

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:37.960
I get beaten up by twerps
and the girl I tried to protect...

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:39.930
<i>Dog...</i>

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.530
...calls me a dog.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:43.600
Damn her!

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:53.980
Uh-oh...

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:02.590
Damn her...

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:06.090
She's a harpy!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.300
Am I getting a chill
from my short hair?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:17.270
Turns out the red slip Tsukushi got
wasn't from the F4.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.170
Oh? Then who?

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.010
Who cares?

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:24.640
I wouldn't mind giving her
a red card, myself.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:29.180
Well, why don't you?!

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:38.720
What's with that hair?!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.100
Watch it!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.680
I'm sorry, Nishikado...

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.460
What happened to your hair?
You look like...

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.030
Kintaro...

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.580
Yeah, Kintaro. How'd you guess?

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.500
Everyone's been telling me that.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.970
Did you cut it yourself?

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:30.070
My mother.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.530
Why not go to a salon?
You're a girl, aren't you?

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:33.380
No money.

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.510
You poor thing!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.020
Shall I cut it for you?

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.490
I've always been good
at arts and crafts...

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.960
<i>Arts and crafts?</i>

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:56.500
You're going to use a matte knife?

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.570
It's all I've got.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.980
It looks like Kintaro because
it's straight at the bottom.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:07.450
It'll look better if you make it
a bit layered.

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:21.430
<i>How bizarre... Rui Hanazawa's
cutting my hair.</i>

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.600
You went through a lot too
this time too, didn't you?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:27.470
Yeah...

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:30.740
Where's Domyoji today?

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.840
He's out of the hospital,
but he's still resting.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:35.610
Seems his bones
haven't mended completely, yet.

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:38.110
I see...

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.910
We grew up together,
but I've never seen him like that.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:44.750
We were stunned.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.790
It shows just how much
he loves you.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.590
You do know that, don't you?

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:55.930
<i>True, it moved me...</i>

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.570
<i>Domyoji, whose pride is bigger
than Mt. Everest...</i>

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.240
<i>just stood there and took it...</i>

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.100
<i>But, do I feel...</i>

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:19.150
<i>the same excitement I felt
when I loved Rui Hanazawa?</i>

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.890
Aren't you having fun...

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.130
I was just getting my hair cut...
Isn't that right, Rui Hanazawa?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:33.800
I'm finished.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:36.800
Weren't you taking the day off?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.540
It got boring resting at home.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:48.180
Wow! It looks great!
Thank you, Rui Hanazawa!

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.280
I'll see you later.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:54.390
I haven't told her about the party.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:58.390
Party?

00:08:01.130 --> 00:08:04.060
Do you know what this Sunday is?

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.360
No, I don't.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.130
You don't? It's my birthday.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:11.870
Happy birthday.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:19.680
I have a birthday party
at my home every year.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:21.580
Come with a present.

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:23.790
But I don't have any money.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.120
Then, don't bring anything.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:28.120
Come to make up
for all the pain I've suffered.

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.260
My mother and sister will be there,
so dress up.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.330
Y-your mother?

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.130
Your mother's coming back
from overseas, too?

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.800
Seems my dad's too busy to come.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:42.330
I'll introduce you.

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:44.940
<i>Introduce me?</i>

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:49.410
<i>Is he serious?!</i>

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.120
Sengoku-ya

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.150
It's like you're his fianc馥!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:07.650
"Mother, this is the girl
I want to marry," he'll say.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.190
Shut up! We aren't even dating!

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.130
You'll be marrying into high society...

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:17.870
I said shut up! I'm trying to come up
with a present!

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:23.570
I wouldn't dare go without one...

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.880
Then, why don't you make something,
like a cake?

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.160
<i>Make something, huh?</i>

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:19.830
<i>What's up with the luxury cars?</i>

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.440
<i>This party must be bigger than I thought.</i>

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.880
The entrance is this way.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:36.950
Welcome...

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:40.220
...to Tsukasa Domyoji's
18th birthday party.

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:40.240
Why are you so dressed up?

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:44.650
Why else? For the Domyojis'
only son's party!

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:46.880
What are you wearing under that coat?

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:52.890
One of my mom's dresses from when she
was younger. Fashion repeats itself!

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:57.880
- Just as I thought.
- This is no good.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:11:58.900
What shall we do?

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.630
What? It's just a birthday, isn't it?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:07.670
The thing is,
it's not just anything.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.380
Welcome, Tsukushi...

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.050
Thank you for coming to see
my foolish brother.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:20.650
It's nice to see you again.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:24.790
Tsubaki... You're gorgeous!

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:27.160
Thank you.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.060
You came back from America
for the party today?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:33.160
Yes. The whole family
gets together each year.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.500
Tsubaki, can you lend her
something to wear?

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.470
But she looks cute as-is.

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:42.840
Well, auntie's here today, isn't she?

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:45.980
Yes, that's right...

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:55.150
<i>What's this weird vibe I'm getting? 
Is "auntie" Domyoji's mother?</i>

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:01.530
Why don't we get changed?

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.830
You can wear
one of my old school outfits.

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:08.230
I think it'll look good on you.

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.910
<i>Look good on me?</i>

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:17.910
<i>We're completely different heights
and body types.</i>

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.130
Have all the guests arrived?

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:34.730
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:37.360
Shall we get started?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.830
Certainly, ma'am.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.440
It's filmy. Clean it again.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.810
Nothing must go wrong
at a Domyoji party.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.910
Are you ready, Tsukasa?

00:13:58.750 --> 00:13:59.350
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.390
Well?

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:24.080
Let's see... Try <i>this</i> on. This one!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:44.100
How about this one?
I had it custom made in middle school.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.760
This has to fit.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:47.100
You know...

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.270
Why do I have to dress up like this?

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.940
Is there some special meaning
to tonight's party?

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:02.710
You're right...

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.580
I'm sorry for doing this to you
without explaining.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:10.690
The thing is...

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.330
Tsukasa's mother is really scary.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.460
They're right.
She's very hard to please.

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.300
She's especially hard on women.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:25.100
If she finds out
that Tsukasa's invited a girl... well...

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.570
He's the heir to this family, after all...

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.880
The family's future, you know...

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:34.150
The future?

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.110
His marriage... Marriage...

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.980
She'll appraise you
as a potential fianc馥.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:40.950
M-marriage?!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:48.090
Cheers! Happy birthday!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.700
I-I-I'm going home.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:55.530
H-hey!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.670
Wait, Makino!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:00.970
I'm only here for his birthday.
I didn't sign on for this!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.540
Just listen, will you?

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:14.920
It's the same with all of us
who are sons of entrepreneurs.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:20.060
They put us into <i>proper</i> schools
from kindergarten

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.430
so that we don't mingle
with riff-raff.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:39.880
Arranged marriage?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:50.120
We've all had it pounded into us
since we were little...

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:56.590
We'll never be able to marry
someone we choose.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.830
I envy you common people.

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:10.980
So, please act like a lady today,
for Tsukasa's sake. Please.

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:15.680
Because you and Tsukasa...

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.690
...will never be together anyway.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.560
<i>I see...</i>

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:32.760
<i>Then, there's no reason
for me to be worried.</i>

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:37.140
<i>Of course. I should have known.</i>

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:42.010
<i>I don't belong here.</i>

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:01.330
Excuse me...

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.330
You're late.
Did you just get here?

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.100
Hmm... You look like a debutante.

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.770
But I'm only an imitation...

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:10.840
Imi...

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:12.870
It's nothing.

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.540
Look at you, young man...
Your necktie's crooked.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:21.580
Listen, you...

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.350
Let's see... What shall I eat?

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:34.360
Happy Birthday

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:40.000
What about my present?

00:18:40.730 --> 00:18:41.530
I forgot it.

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.300
Forgot it?

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:44.940
Sorry.

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:55.380
What do you mean, "sorry"?
You idiot!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:56.580
Now, now...

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:13.360
<i>How could I possibly
give it to him?</i>

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.970
<i>Such a silly gift
that didn't cost a penny.</i>

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:22.420
Come on. I'll introduce you
to my mother.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:23.110
What?!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:24.840
You dope!

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:27.050
It's no big deal.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.180
I'm not introducing you
as my fianc馥, after all.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.380
N-No thank you!

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.120
C 'mon, hurry up.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:42.360
Tsukasa...

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:49.430
Will you introduce me
to this young lady?

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:04.950
<i>It's Domyoji's mother...</i>

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:22.930
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.910
Who are you?

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:36.280
<i>She's scary... So imposing...</i>

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:49.990
Mother...

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.200
Mother, this is...

00:20:53.460 --> 00:20:54.270
This is...

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:01.040
...the most important woman
in my life.

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:04.640
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:09.410
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:18.850
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:24.660
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:32.430
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.430 --> 00:22:38.040
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:44.680
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:51.050
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:57.960
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:06.830
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.130 --> 00:23:14.740
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:20.810
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.350 --> 00:23:28.090
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:31.460
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:37.330
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:49.140
I shouldn't have come.

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:52.280
Domyoji's mother relentlessly hounds
Domyoji and me...

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:54.610
...about our relationship
in her imposing way.

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:57.980
Then Domyoji grabs me and
makes a break for it.

00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:00.720
Like mother, like son!

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:03.890
Hana Yori Dango: 
"Lovers on the Run?!"

00:24:04.360 --> 00:24:08.830
My life is getting sucked up
in the whirlpool of the Domyoji family...
